The USB protocol implementation (ThermalInspector/Camera/P3Protocol.swift,
ThermalInspector/Camera/P3FrameAssembler.swift and
ThermalInspector/Platform/macOS/P3Camera.swift) is a Swift port of the Python driver
from Thermal Camera Viewer <https://github.com/skywalker1905/thermal-camera-viewer>,
Copyright Thermal Camera Viewer contributors, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

That driver includes substantial portions derived from p3-ir-camera
<https://github.com/jvdillon/p3-ir-camera>, Copyright Joshua V. Dillon and
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and is based on
USB traffic analysis by @aeternium
<https://github.com/jvdillon/p3-ir-camera/issues/2>.

Changes compared to the original: rewritten in Swift for macOS using Apple's
IOUSBHost framework instead of PyUSB/libusb.

